# LATENCY-1 evidence — wall-clock render latency (fable challenger, 2026-09-24)
# Machine: this lab VM (loaded; figures are upper bounds, single runs unless noted).
# Bars: <60 s = 1x real-time minimum; <15 s = RT-capable; >60 s = offline-only.
# Method: time.perf_counter() around direct subprocess calls (no /usr/bin/time on this VM).
#
# AUDIO — 60 s fixture (fable_chal/fixtures/region1.txt, 2,646,000 samples @44.1 kHz):
#   contender   binary                              wall      bytes out      class
#   PAR/off     crew_servo/src/render_servo_off      12.87 s   5,292,000      RT-capable
#   A           (cited: crew_a/RUNLOG.md, wait4)     0.92 s CPU (median, contention-free) RT-capable
#   B           crew_b/src/render_b_fix              19.94 s   21,168,000     >=1x, NOT RT-capable
#   stock-C     crew_servo/src/render_c_stock        15.81 s   5,292,000      >=1x, NOT RT-capable (borderline)
#   gated-C     crew_servo/src/render_c_gated        11.84 s   5,292,000      RT-capable
#   gfable-C    crew_servo/src/render_c_gfable       13.51 s   5,292,000      RT-capable
#   D1          crew_d/src/render_d1                 10.18 s   2,646,044      RT-capable
#   D2          crew_d/src/render_d2                 9.60 s    2,646,044      RT-capable
#   native(D)   crew_d/src/render_native             12.47 s   2,646,044      RT-capable
#   All rc=0. Note: B's region-state reseed costs latency: B is the slowest audio
#   contender (1.7x slower than gated-C) while winning REGION-1 on phase continuity.
#
# IMAGE (crew_paths, 96x64 raster, 10-20 renders per mode, mean):
#   nat 17.2 ms | a 55.6 ms | b 48.9 ms | c 141.8 ms | d1 19.4 ms | d2 14.2 ms per render
#   RT@30fps budget = 33 ms: nat/d1/d2 pass; a/b/c miss (c = 8.2x slower than nat — servo tax).
#
# DIALOGUE (crew_paths, 2000-turn file, all modes):
#   nat 56,360 | a 71,796 | b 49,563 | c 80,942 | d1 63,210 | d2 46,568 turns/s
#   All modes >> interactive real time (a turn at 50k/s = 0.02 ms).
#
# GENERATIVE VIDEO TEMPO-1 (crew_paths fable_chal, 300 frames 320x240):
#   par 5.19/3.49 s | b 5.37/7.21 s (RT@30fps = 10 s) -> both faster than real time.
#
# SYNC-1 VIDEO (fable_chal, 1800 frames 64x48 @60fps, RT = 30 s):
#   vpar ~1.5-2.7 s | vservo similar -> ~15x real time.
# SYNC-1 AUDIO (fable_chal, 30 s @44.1 kHz, RT = 30 s):
#   apar ~3 s (10x RT) | baudio ~8-10 s (3x RT).
#
# PREDICTIVE VIDEO (crew_paths, 8-frame render, 3-5 renders per mode, mean):
#   nat 0.108 s | apar 0.027 s | b 0.005 s | c 0.004 s | d1 0.005 s | d2 0.004 s
#   (modes differ in workload: nat is sequential simulation; b/c/d are plan-seeded shortcuts.)
#
# Latency artifacts: fable_chal/artifacts/WITHHELD-NOT-FOR-REVIEW/fable_chal/latency/ (li_*.raw, lvp_*.raw,
# turns2000.txt). Audio latency renders: fable_chal/artifacts/WITHHELD-NOT-FOR-REVIEW/fable_chal/region1/.
